      "end_time": 49.6,
      "text": "I'll do it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 54.6,
      "end_time": 55.6,
      "text": "We're not done yet!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 56.2,
      "end_time": 57.5,
      "text": "Frozen Lake"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 62.6,
      "end_time": 63.7,
      "text": "Nice!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 63.9,
      "end_time": 65.6,
      "text": "Once we get past this slope..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 67.5,
      "end_time": 69.5,
      "text": "The enemy will be right in front of us...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 72.5,
      "end_time": 75.3,
      "text": "Hya-hoo, how crazy is that☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 79.2,
      "end_time": 81.9,
      "text": "Everyoneeee! Heyas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 82.1,
      "end_time": 83.6,
      "text": "Kyaru-san, prepare to fire!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 84.1,
      "end_time": 86.3,
      "text": "Yes, I'll kill that thing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 93.3,
      "end_time": 94.4,
      "text": "SHOOT!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 94.6,
      "end_time": 96.5,
      "text": "Our shot..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 98.1,
      "end_time": 98.9,
      "text": "Take it☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 104.5,
      "end_time": 106.2,
      "text": "Go for it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 116.1,
      "end_time": 119.2,
      "text": "Wow, that tank really flew☆"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 119.5,
      "end_time": 123.9,
      "text": "That settles it... I'm glad, but..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 124.2,
